{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XAM4CkSn1NEFHGoR61LV91","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Class: org.mybatis.jpetstore.domain.Cart\nSummary: The Cart class represents a shopping cart in the application. It manages a collection of CartItem objects, allowing items to be added, removed, and updated. It also provides methods to retrieve the total cost of items in the cart and check if specific items are present. Key methods include addItem (adds an item to the cart), removeItemById (removes an item by its ID), incrementQuantityByItemId (increments the quantity of an item), setQuantityByItemId (sets the quantity of an item), and getSubTotal (calculates the total cost of items in the cart). The class uses synchronized collections to ensure thread safety. It implements Serializable for potential serialization needs.\nFile Path: resources/jpetstore-6/src/main/java/org/mybatis/jpetstore/domain/Cart.java"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ade53ddf-4739-4209-a6fc-293689a3bab4","uuid":"8fba1d06-bd11-4bd1-81aa-ede26b097e5b","timestamp":"2026-11-14T23:02:48.379Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"Class: org.mybatis.jpetstore.domain.Cart\nSummary: The Cart class represents a shopping cart in the application. It manages a collection of CartItem objects, allowing items to be added, removed, and updated. It also provides methods to retrieve the total cost of items in the cart and check if specific items are present. Key methods include addItem (adds an item to the cart), removeItemById (removes an item by its ID), incrementQuantityByItemId (increments the quantity of an item), setQuantityByItemId (sets the quantity of an item), and getSubTotal (calculates the total cost of items in the cart). The class uses synchronized collections to ensure thread safety. It implements Serializable for potential serialization needs.\nFile Path: resources/jpetstore-6/src/main/java/org/mybatis/jpetstore/domain/Cart.java